This folder stores versioned Appium Studio test reports.

Each build version gets its own subfolder:

  reports/
  ├── v1.0.0/
  │   ├── data.json    ← parsed test results
  │   └── meta.json    ← version metadata (savedAt, summary counts)
  ├── v1.1.0/
  │   ├── data.json
  │   └── meta.json
  └── ...

To add a new report:
  python3 scripts/save_report.py --version v1.2.0 --report path/to/report.html
